---
// Click-to-edit preview only: the handle for dragging a block (or a column, or a chosen person)
// into a new order. It is not a click target itself, so pressing on it is pressing on the element
// around it, which carries the item's data-sanity attribute. Shown while the mouse is over that
// element (global.css, .edit-grip). Never rendered in public builds: callers only add it when
// the element has a click target.
---

<span class="edit-grip" aria-hidden="true" title="Drag to move"></span>
